@startuml signal-processing-flow
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif

title Signal 层目标处理主流程

rectangle "环境建模输入\n传播损耗 / 杂波 / 干扰" as ENV
rectangle "回波计算" as ECHO
rectangle "信号检测\n输出有效量测" as DETECT
rectangle "数据关联\n量测-航迹匹配" as ASSOC
rectangle "跟踪滤波\n状态预测与更新" as FILTER
rectangle "轨迹管理\n建轨/确认/丢失/回收" as LIFECYCLE
rectangle "稳定航迹快照\n供决策层/目标分类使用" as SNAPSHOT
rectangle "轨迹对象池\n仅内存复用" as POOL

ENV --> ECHO
ECHO --> DETECT
DETECT --> ASSOC
ASSOC --> FILTER
FILTER --> LIFECYCLE
LIFECYCLE --> SNAPSHOT
LIFECYCLE --> POOL : 申请/归还对象

note right of ASSOC
只负责匹配关系，
不负责建轨与删轨。
end note

note right of FILTER
只负责状态估计，
不负责生命周期状态机。
end note

note right of LIFECYCLE
统一维护候选、确认、丢失、回收。
是目标分类的直接上游。
end note

note bottom of POOL
对象池只承担内存复用职责。
end note

@enduml
